<title>POLAND: FARM FOOD TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 38.5.</title>
<headline>FARM FOOD TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 38.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 35,000 shares in Polish food producer Farm Food SA at 38.5 zlotys per share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Farm Food rose 0.6 percent to 33.7 zlotys in a volume of 2,717 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
